const governanceTable = `# .github/pull_request_template.md — gives every agent PR the same reviewable shape
## Plan (required)
- **Goal:**
- **Scope (paths):**
- **Steps:**
- **Success criteria:**
- **Rollback / escalation:**

## Evidence
- Workflow run:
- Scan results:`;
