<NoteLayout
  slug="agentic-foundations"
  description="GH-600 foundations: assistant versus agent, the plan → act → evaluate lifecycle, GitHub as system of record and control plane, the contributor model, accountability, every Copilot agent surface, the customization stack and the renames you will meet."
