      <li><a href="#lifecycle">The plan → act → evaluate lifecycle</a> — and why evaluation must use system signals</li>
      <li><a href="#control-plane">GitHub as system of record and control plane</a> — the controls that supervise agents</li>
      <li><a href="#accountability">Accountability and the contributor model</a> — who owns outcomes, and how to judge agent work</li>
      <li><a href="#surfaces">Where Copilot agents run</a> — cloud agent, CLI, IDE, SDK, agentic workflows, automations</li>
